        {
          "id": 805064723,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Cherry-picking for back port to stable releases is another workflow, not linked to the status of the Issue at hand. Therefore we prefer to finalize things first for the development tree, and then cherry-pick our way through all Merge Requests.\n\nClosing #17840",
          "author": {
            "id": 2398962,
